TERN mode
=========

Native integration of the TERN HF weak-signal mode.

The codec modules in this directory are vendored from the TERN reference
implementation:

    https://github.com/isakruas/tern
    revision eaa9b11
    Copyright 2026 Isak Paulo de Andrade Ruas
    GPL-3.0-or-later

Vendored modules (unchanged from upstream): tern_kinds, tern_params,
tern_bits, tern_audio, tern_polar, tern_frame, tern_mod, tern_demod,
tern_channel, tern_rng.

WSJT-X integration written for this tree: tern_glue, tern_modem,
tern_decode, gentern (TX/RX glue), and ternsim (validation driver).

Licensed under the GNU GPL v3 or later, like WSJT-X (see ../../COPYING).
